@format 1
@id merge.auto-group
@title Automatically group merge files
@area Merge
@entry input
@summary Derive merge groups from filename stems and numeric runs using strict or loose automatic grouping.
@flow TB
@related merge.move-file, queue.create-merge-work

@alias group = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PGroup

[input] Automatic grouping selected <input>
- Receive strict or loose automatic grouping mode @ group.PGroupAutoApply(...)
> resolve

[resolve] Derive groups <process>
- Parse filenames and divide sorted files into compatible runs @ group.PGroupAutoResolve(...)
- Replace the group model and rebuild the visible group cards @ group.PGroupAutoUpdate(...)
> result

[result] Automatic groups visible <output>
= Merge groups reflect the selected strictness and current source list.
